ENTITY RVdown
QUALIFY RVdown kind relation
QUALIFY RVdown type tau_R
RTYPE RVdown tau_V tau_V
QUALIFY RVdown functional true

EDGE V1 RVdown V7 1

EDGE V2 RVdown V1 1

EDGE V3 RVdown V2 1

EDGE V4 RVdown V3 1

EDGE V5 RVdown V4 1

EDGE V6 RVdown V5 1

EDGE V7 RVdown V6 1

ENTITY U1_3
QUALIFY U1_3 kind stream
QUALIFY U1_3 type Stream(tau_V)
AT U1_3 I0 V2
AT U1_3 I1 V1
AT U1_3 I2 V7

ENTITY T1_3
QUALIFY T1_3 kind task
QUALIFY T1_3 context CX1C
QUALIFY T1_3 input U1_3
QUALIFY T1_3 available_relation R0
QUALIFY T1_3 available_relation R1
QUALIFY T1_3 available_relation R2
QUALIFY T1_3 available_relation RVup
QUALIFY T1_3 available_relation RVdown

UNKNOWN_AT T1_3 X1_3 U1_3 I3 tau_V

CONSTRAINT SAME_RELATION_SUCCESSIVE C1_3 U1_3
QUALIFY T1_3 constraint C1_3
